---
import ServicePage from '../../components/ServicePage.astro';
---
<ServicePage
  serviceKey="retail"
  seoTitle="Retail Spaces Leasing and Selling in Ahmedabad"
  seoDescription="Lease or buy retail space in Ahmedabad with City Property Services: high street shops, showrooms and food spaces chosen for visibility and footfall."
  eyebrow="Retail spaces"
  heading="Retail Spaces Leasing and Selling"
  intro="Retail works when customers can find you, reach you and remember you. We help brands and businesses secure shops, showrooms and food spaces in the right spots, where footfall and visibility actually support your sales."
  lead={[
    "The best retail address depends on what you sell and who you sell to. A jewellery showroom, a quick service cafe and a car display each need something different from their location.",
    "We know which high streets, shopping centres and developing retail pockets in Ahmedabad suit different kinds of businesses, so you spend on a space that works for your brand, not just any vacant shop.",
  ]}
  helpItems={[
    "Shops and showrooms for apparel, jewellery, electronics and beauty",
    "Spaces for restaurants, cafes and food and beverage brands",
    "Showrooms for automobiles, furniture and large format retail",
    "Units for gaming, services and experience led stores",
    "High street addresses, shopping centres and busy main roads",
    "Site selection, negotiation and leasing or selling support",
  ]}
  idealFor={["Retail brands", "Restaurants and cafes", "Showrooms", "Apparel and jewellery", "Electronics and beauty", "Franchise outlets"]}
  support={[
    { title: "Understand your brand and customer", text: "We look at what you sell, your target customer and the kind of visibility your brand needs." },
    { title: "Match you to the right pocket", text: "We suggest locations with the footfall, frontage and customer access that suit your format." },
    { title: "Check the practical details", text: "Signage rights, frontage width, parking, neighbouring brands and customer flow all get a proper look." },
    { title: "Negotiate the deal", text: "We help you agree fair terms, a workable fit out window and clear conditions." },
    { title: "Lease or buy with confidence", text: "We guide the documentation and handover so you can open on time." },
  ]}
  ctaLabel="Explore Retail Spaces"
  formIntent="Retail"
  sizeHint="e.g. 600 sqft on a high street, or a mall unit"
  relatedCategory="commercial"
  landingTypes={["shop", "showroom"]}
  faq={[
    { q: 'What does a showroom or shop cost to rent in Ahmedabad?', a: 'Our {rentCount} current retail listings carry asking rents from {rentRange}. Ground-floor frontage on SG Highway, CG Road and Sindhu Bhavan Road commands the highest rates; upper floors and side roads cost considerably less.' },
    { q: 'Which localities have retail space available now?', a: 'We hold {count} shop and showroom listings across {localityCount} localities, with the most options in {topLocalities}. The locality pages below show every current space with size and price.' },
    { q: 'What should a brand check before leasing a showroom?', a: 'Frontage width and visibility from the road, signage rights, parking, power load, floor-to-ceiling height, fire NOC and whether the building allows your category of use. We check these on every visit and flag anything that would block your fit-out.' },
    { q: 'Do you handle pre-leased retail for investors?', a: 'Yes. Some of our showroom listings are already leased to operating tenants and are sold as income assets. We share the lease term, lock-in, escalation and tenant profile so you can judge the yield before visiting.' },
    { q: 'How long does it take to find a retail space?', a: 'For standard requirements we usually shortlist within a week and close within four to eight weeks, depending on negotiation and fit-out. High-street frontage in the most sought-after stretches can take longer because supply is limited.' },
  ]}
/>
